{
 "schema_version": "0.1",
 "id": "pokhran",
 "title": "India Blew Up the White House",
 "description": "Pokhran-II (Operation Shakti), May 1998: how India hid its nuclear tests from US spy satellites.",
 "set": "specs/sets/pokhran.json",
 "format": {
  "resolution": [
   1080,
   1920
  ],
  "fps": 60,
  "motion_blur": 2
 },
 "narration": {
  "model": "gemini-3.8-flash-lite-tts",
  "voice": "Charon",
  "single_take": true,
  "inline_tags": true,
  "max_pause": 0.4,
  "style": "highly expressive, gripping storyteller for a viral YouTube Short about a true heist",
  "speed": 1.0
 },
 "captions": {
  "enabled": true,
  "max_words": 2,
  "position": 0.87
 },
 "ambience": [
  {
   "sound": "beat",
   "gain": -21,
   "duck": 0.55
  }
 ],
 "sfx": [],
 "lines": [
  {
   "id": "l1a",
   "shot": "hook_feed",
   "at": 0.05,
   "text": "India blew up the White House.",
   "style": "mischievously"
  },
  {
   "id": "l1b",
   "shot": "hook_analyst",
   "at": 0.05,
   "text": "And America only found out when India announced it.",
   "style": "sarcastic"
  },
  {
   "id": "l2a",
   "shot": "feed_rewind",
   "at": 0.15,
   "text": "Not that White House.",
   "style": "laughs"
  },
  {
   "id": "l2b",
   "shot": "range_noon",
   "at": 0.05,
   "text": "A shaft in the Rajasthan desert,",
   "style": "whispers"
  },
  {
   "id": "l2c",
   "shot": "shaft_dive",
   "at": 0.0,
   "text": "two hundred metres deep,",
   "style": "whispers"
  },
  {
   "id": "l2d",
   "shot": "lid_chalk",
   "at": 0.0,
   "text": "code-named White House.",
   "style": "mischievously"
  },
  {
   "id": "l2e",
   "shot": "device_inside",
   "at": 0.1,
   "text": "With a hydrogen bomb inside.",
   "style": "whispers"
  },
  {
   "id": "l3a",
   "shot": "rewind",
   "at": 0.25,
   "text": "Rewind to 1995.",
   "style": "serious"
  },
  {
   "id": "l3b",
   "shot": "range_1995",
   "at": 0.1,
   "text": "Imagine you're India's nuclear team, getting ready to test right here.",
   "style": "excited"
  },
  {
   "id": "l3c",
   "shot": "sat_turn",
   "at": 0.05,
   "text": "But American spy satellites are watching.",
   "style": "tense"
  },
  {
   "id": "l4a",
   "shot": "nyt_slap",
   "at": 0.15,
   "text": "The New York Times prints it.",
   "style": "tense"
  },
  {
   "id": "l4b",
   "shot": "wisner_photos",
   "at": 0.0,
   "text": "The US ambassador shows up with the photos.",
   "style": "tense"
  },
  {
   "id": "l4c",
   "shot": "rao_phone",
   "at": 0.0,
   "text": "President Clinton calls your Prime Minister.",
   "style": "tense"
  },
  {
   "id": "l4d",
   "shot": "shovel_back",
   "at": 0.0,
   "text": "Test cancelled.",
   "style": "sighs"
  },
  {
   "id": "l5a",
   "shot": "office_1998",
   "at": 0.25,
   "text": "Now it's 1998.",
   "style": "excited"
  },
  {
   "id": "l5b",
   "shot": "vajpayee_order",
   "at": 0.05,
   "text": "A new Prime Minister, Atal Bihari Vajpayee, gives the order: do it again.",
   "style": "proud"
  },
  {
   "id": "l5c",
   "shot": "same_desert",
   "at": 0.1,
   "text": "Same desert. Same satellites.",
   "style": "serious"
  },
  {
   "id": "l5d",
   "shot": "team_lookup",
   "at": 0.0,
   "text": "But this time, they must see nothing.",
   "style": "whispers"
  },
  {
   "id": "l6a",
   "shot": "night_work",
   "at": 0.2,
   "text": "So you work only at night.",
   "style": "whispers"
  },
  {
   "id": "l6b",
   "shot": "truck_park",
   "at": 0.05,
   "text": "And by sunrise, every truck is back in its exact parking spot,",
   "style": "mischievously"
  },
  {
   "id": "l6c",
   "shot": "photos_same",
   "at": 0.0,
   "text": "so the morning photos look the same.",
   "style": "chuckles"
  },
  {
   "id": "l7a",
   "shot": "dune_shape",
   "at": 0.15,
   "text": "The sand you dig out? Shaped by hand into dunes, the way the wind would make them.",
   "style": "excited"
  },
  {
   "id": "l7b",
   "shot": "net_drape",
   "at": 0.05,
   "text": "The shafts hide under camouflage nets.",
   "style": "whispers"
  },
  {
   "id": "l8a",
   "shot": "pass_watch",
   "at": 0.2,
   "text": "When a satellite passes overhead,",
   "style": "tense"
  },
  {
   "id": "l8b",
   "shot": "statue",
   "at": 0.0,
   "text": "work stops.",
   "style": "whispers"
  },
  {
   "id": "l8c",
   "shot": "cricket",
   "at": 0.15,
   "text": "In between, the soldiers play cricket,",
   "style": "laughs"
  },
  {
   "id": "l8d",
   "shot": "cricket_feed",
   "at": 0.0,
   "text": "so the pictures show a bored army camp.",
   "style": "sarcastic"
  },
  {
   "id": "l9a",
   "shot": "jeep_arrive",
   "at": 0.2,
   "text": "Your scientists arrive dressed as soldiers.",
   "style": "chuckles"
  },
  {
   "id": "l9b",
   "shot": "kalam_tape",
   "at": 0.05,
   "text": "Even India's missile man, Abdul Kalam, gets a fake army name: Prithviraj.",
   "style": "mischievously"
  },
  {
   "id": "l10a",
   "shot": "an32_land",
   "at": 0.2,
   "text": "The bombs arrive at dawn: flown in from Mumbai on an air force plane,",
   "style": "serious"
  },
  {
   "id": "l10b",
   "shot": "convoy",
   "at": 0.0,
   "text": "then driven into the desert by an army convoy.",
   "style": "serious"
  },
  {
   "id": "l11a",
   "shot": "cage_lower",
   "at": 0.15,
   "text": "Three go down into the shafts.",
   "style": "serious"
  },
  {
   "id": "l11b",
   "shot": "lid_wh",
   "at": 0.05,
   "text": "Code names: White House,",
   "style": "mischievously"
  },
  {
   "id": "l11c",
   "shot": "lid_taj",
   "at": 0.0,
   "text": "Taj Mahal,",
   "style": "mischievously"
  },
  {
   "id": "l11d",
   "shot": "lid_kumbh",
   "at": 0.0,
   "text": "and Kumbhkaran.",
   "style": "laughs"
  },
  {
   "id": "l12a",
   "shot": "clock_nine",
   "at": 0.25,
   "text": "May 11th. Everything is set for nine a.m.",
   "style": "tense"
  },
  {
   "id": "l12b",
   "shot": "windsock",
   "at": 0.05,
   "text": "Then the wind blows the wrong way.",
   "style": "sighs"
  },
  {
   "id": "l12c",
   "shot": "village_far",
   "at": 0.0,
   "text": "If anything leaks, it must not drift toward people.",
   "style": "serious"
  },
  {
   "id": "l13a",
   "shot": "wait_row",
   "at": 0.2,
   "text": "So the most secret team in India just waits.",
   "style": "sighs"
  },
  {
   "id": "l13b",
   "shot": "wait_clock",
   "at": 0.1,
   "text": "Six hours. Staring at the wind.",
   "style": "serious"
  },
  {
   "id": "l14a",
   "shot": "wind_turns",
   "at": 0.3,
   "text": "At three forty-five p.m., the wind turns.",
   "style": "tense"
  },
  {
   "id": "l14b",
   "shot": "key_turn",
   "at": 0.05,
   "text": "The key turns.",
   "style": "whispers"
  },
  {
   "id": "l14c",
   "shot": "desert_jumps",
   "at": 0.05,
   "text": "The desert jumps.",
   "style": "shouting"
  },
  {
   "id": "l14d",
   "shot": "khetolai_crack",
   "at": 0.15,
   "text": "In Khetolai, the nearest village, people say their walls cracked.",
   "style": "serious"
  },
  {
   "id": "l15a",
   "shot": "presser_walk",
   "at": 0.25,
   "text": "Hours later, Vajpayee walks out to the cameras:",
   "style": "proud"
  },
  {
   "id": "l15b",
   "shot": "presser_quote",
   "at": 0.05,
   "text": "Today, at fifteen forty-five hours, India conducted three underground nuclear tests in the Pokhran range.",
   "style": "serious"
  },
  {
   "id": "l16a",
   "shot": "phones_ring",
   "at": 0.2,
   "text": "In Washington, the phones start ringing.",
   "style": "excited"
  },
  {
   "id": "l16b",
   "shot": "analyst_feed",
   "at": 0.0,
   "text": "America's spies had missed the whole thing.",
   "style": "sarcastic"
  },
  {
   "id": "l17a",
   "shot": "senator",
   "at": 0.15,
   "text": "A US senator calls it a colossal failure.",
   "style": "sarcastic"
  },
  {
   "id": "l17b",
   "shot": "review_drop",
   "at": 0.05,
   "text": "The CIA's own review finds it simply assumed India would never test.",
   "style": "laughs"
  },
  {
   "id": "l18a",
   "shot": "two_more",
   "at": 0.2,
   "text": "Two days later, you test two more.",
   "style": "proud"
  },
  {
   "id": "l18b",
   "shot": "lok_sabha",
   "at": 0.05,
   "text": "On May 27th, Vajpayee tells Parliament: India is now a nuclear weapon state.",
   "style": "proud"
  },
  {
   "id": "l19a",
   "shot": "kalam_cap",
   "at": 0.3,
   "text": "Four years later, the scientist with the fake army name,",
   "style": "proud"
  },
  {
   "id": "l19c",
   "shot": "never_noticed",
   "at": 0.0,
   "text": "the one the satellites never noticed,",
   "style": "chuckles"
  },
  {
   "id": "l19b",
   "shot": "rashtrapati",
   "at": 0.0,
   "text": "becomes the President of India.",
   "style": "excited"
  },
  {
   "id": "l20",
   "shot": "tech_day",
   "at": 0.3,
   "text": "And every May 11th, India celebrates National Technology Day.",
   "style": "proud"
  },
  {
   "id": "l21a",
   "shot": "end_range",
   "at": 0.25,
   "text": "All because of one afternoon in the desert,",
   "style": "serious"
  },
  {
   "id": "l21b",
   "shot": "end_feed",
   "at": 0.0,
   "text": "when India blew up the White House.",
   "style": "mischievously"
  }
 ],
